@startuml
title USEI11 – Directed Line Upgrade Plan

actor "Infrastructure Planner" as P
participant "System Controller" as SC
participant "UpgradePlannerService" as UPS
participant "DirectedGraph" as G

P -> SC : 1. Request upgrade plan(dependencyGraph)
activate SC

SC -> SC : 2. Validate graph structure\n(vertices, edges)

SC -> UPS : 3. computeUpgradePlan(graph)
activate UPS

UPS -> G : 4. calculateInDegrees()
activate G
G --> UPS : 5. Return in-degree map
deactivate G

UPS -> G : 6. getZeroInDegreeVertices()
activate G
G --> UPS : 7. Return initial candidates
deactivate G

UPS -> UPS : 8. Perform topological sort\n(Kahn's Algorithm)

UPS -> UPS : 9. Detect cycle if vertices remain unprocessed

UPS --> SC : 10. Return upgrade order\nor cycle error
deactivate UPS

SC --> P : 11. Present upgrade plan\nor dependency conflict
deactivate SC

P -> P : 12. Analyze and confirm upgrade sequence

@enduml
